<title>UK: BP to shut Rotterdam Pernis refinery early.</title>
<headline>BP to shut Rotterdam Pernis refinery early.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Plc (BP) said on Tuesday it would be shutting its Pernis refinery in Rotterdam earlier than expected.</p>
<p>&quot;A decision was made to bring forward the date when crude processing would be discontinued at the Pernis refinery in Rotterdam. This will now take place by the end of this year,&quot; BP said in a statement.</p>
</text>
